      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16.308668873362997,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "\nBob publishes the key bundle to the server containing: \n\n  1. Identity key: IKB (public)\n  2. Signed prekey: SPKB + signature\n  3. PQ last-resort prekey: PQSPKB + signature\n\n  4. One-time EC prekeys: OPKB1, OPKB2, ... (unsigned) - optional\n  5. One-time PQ prekeys: PQOPKB1, PQOPKB2, ... (each signed) - optional",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nBob publishes the key bundle to the server containing: \n\n  1. Identity key: IKB (public)\n  2. Signed prekey: SPKB + signature\n  3. PQ last-resort prekey: PQSPKB + signature\n\n  4. One-time EC prekeys: OPKB1, OPKB2, ... (unsigned) - optional\n  5. One-time PQ prekeys: PQOPKB1, PQOPKB2, ... (each signed) - optional",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "index": "aJ",
      "autoResize": true
    },
