      "text": "• Alice’s identity key IKA\n• Alice’s ephemeral key EKA\n• The pqkem ciphertext CT encapsulating SS for PQPKB\nIdentifiers stating which of Bob’s prekeys Alice used\n• enc_message = Enc(\n    key=SK, associated_data=AD, data=plaintext_data\n  )\n, where Enc = some AEAD encryption scheme",
      "fontSize": 15.460791551324963,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Alice’s identity key IKA\n• Alice’s ephemeral key EKA\n• The pqkem ciphertext CT encapsulating SS for PQPKB\nIdentifiers stating which of Bob’s prekeys Alice used\n• enc_message = Enc(\n    key=SK, associated_data=AD, data=plaintext_data\n  )\n, where Enc = some AEAD encryption scheme",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
