      "text": "• Alice's EC Identity Key IKA\n• Alice's EC Ephemeral Key EKA\n• Bob also loads his identity private key and \n    uses the key identifiers to load the private \n    key(s) corresponding to the signed prekeys, \n    one-time prekeys, and KEM key Alice used.",
