      "updated": 1763130775286,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 15.298401447386865,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "- SS = PQKEM-DEC(PQPKB, CT)\n- DH1 = DH(SPKB_priv, IKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(IKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n- DH2 = DH(IKB_priv, EKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(EKA_priv, IKB_pub)\n- DH3 = DH(SPKB_priv, EKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(EKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n- SK = KDF(DH1 || DH2 || DH3 || SS)\n\nIf the curve one-time prekey is used:\n- DH4 = DH(OPKB_priv, EKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(EKA_priv, OPKB_pub)\n- SK = KDF(DH1 || DH2 || DH3 || DH4 || SS)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- SS = PQKEM-DEC(PQPKB, CT)\n- DH1 = DH(SPKB_priv, IKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(IKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n- DH2 = DH(IKB_priv, EKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(EKA_priv, IKB_pub)\n- DH3 = DH(SPKB_priv, EKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(EKA_priv, SPKB_pub)\n- SK = KDF(DH1 || DH2 || DH3 || SS)\n\nIf the curve one-time prekey is used:\n- DH4 = DH(OPKB_priv, EKA_pub) ← Same as Alice's DH(EKA_priv, OPKB_pub)\n- SK = KDF(DH1 || DH2 || DH3 || DH4 || SS)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "index": "ao",
      "autoResize": true
    },
