      "fontSize": 16.308668873362997,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "text": "Bob's key bundle: \n  1. Identity key: IKB (public)\n  2. Signed prekey: SPKB + signature\n  3. PQ last-resort prekey: \n        PQSPKB + signature\n  4. One-time EC prekeys: \n        OPKB1, OPKB2, ... (unsigned)\n  5. One-time PQ prekeys: \n        PQOPKB1, PQOPKB2, ... (each signed)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bob's key bundle: \n  1. Identity key: IKB (public)\n  2. Signed prekey: SPKB + signature\n  3. PQ last-resort prekey: \n        PQSPKB + signature\n  4. One-time EC prekeys: \n        OPKB1, OPKB2, ... (unsigned)\n  5. One-time PQ prekeys: \n        PQOPKB1, PQOPKB2, ... (each signed)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "index": "b04",
      "autoResize": true
    }
